licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The original mod (Just Leveling) was authored by Tobinio. JustLevelingFork
forked it after the original creator lost their source code; Senior-S
re-released a cleaned-up decompilation under Apache 2.0 to allow community
contribution.

Modifications by Silvaria for IridescentCraft (2026):

  - Stripped gun-mod integrations (TacZ, Crayfish, Scorched Guns 2,
    PointBlank, BetterCombat) — IridescentCraft does not ship those mods.
  - Stripped KubeJS plugin subpackage — IridescentCraft's KubeJS scripts
    read aptitude NBT directly, no plugin needed.
  - (Planned) Reassigned native passives across aptitudes (Magic Resist
    moves off MAG; Beneficial Effect moves off MAG).
  - (Planned) Stripped native skill effects on the 24 baseline skills —
    KubeJS layer in IridescentCraft handles all gameplay effects.
  - (Planned) Adjusted skill unlock thresholds from 8/16/24 to 5/10/15/20/30.

The internal modid 'justlevelingfork' is preserved so existing worlds'
aptitude data at ForgeData.justlevelingfork.aptitude.* survives the
upgrade without NBT migration.

